  "_doc": "The Brine Shoals: shore crabs in clusters on the mud-flats west of the ridges and on the tideline below the camp's high hull; gulls work the wreck-ridges and stand on the wrecks (the Lit Age wreck top 2.4, the chalk hull 2.0, the hold hull 2.0) and the tide-wheel (4.0). No water in the greybox, so no fish. Placed on the greybox layout (M3-CRE-615); move the coordinates when env-art's kit replaces the blocks (same keys as ch02_haluna.json). Re-seated on the dressed kit (the Act I audit, 2026-10-29: tools/creatures/wildlife_snap.gd and wildlife_audit.gd, which ray against the zone's visible meshes).",
